 These"," molecules"," scatter"," the"," light"," in"," all"," directions",","," but"," they"," scatter"," shorter"," (","blue",")"," wavelengths"," more"," than"," longer"," (","red",")"," wavelengths","."," This"," is"," known"," as"," Ray","leigh"," scattering",","," named"," after"," the"," British"," physicist"," Lord"," Ray","leigh",","," who"," first"," described"," the"," phenomenon"," in"," the"," ","19","th"," century",".\n\n","As"," a"," result"," of"," this"," scattering",","," the"," blue"," light"," is"," dispersed"," in"," all"," directions",","," giving"," the"," sky"," its"," blue"," appearance","."," The"," other"," colors"," of"," light",","," like"," red"," and"," green",","," are"," scattered"," in"," different"," directions",","," which"," is"," why"," they"," are"," not"," visible"," to"," the"," naked"," eye",".\n\n","However",","," at"," night",","," when"," the"," sun"," is"," below"," the"," horizon",","," the"," sky"," takes"," on"," a"," different"," appearance","."," The"," scattered"," blue"," light"," is"," still"," present",","," but"," it"," is"," also"," reflected"," off"," the"," surface"," of"," the"," Earth",","," such"," as"," oceans",","," lakes",","," and"," rivers",","," and"," the"," ground",","," which"," sc","atters"," the"," light"," even"," more","."," This"," is"," why"," the"," sky"," often"," appears"," white"," or"," light"," gray"," at"," night",".\n\n","Additionally",","," the"," color"," of"," the"," sky"," can"," also"," be"," influenced"," by"," atmospheric"," conditions",","," such"," as"," pollution",","," dust",","," and"," water"," vapor",","," which"," can"],"mac":["The"," sky"," appears"," blue"," because"," of"," a"," phenomenon"," called"," Ray","leigh"," scattering",","," named"," after"," the"," British"," physicist"," Lord"," Ray","leigh",","," who"," first"," described"," it"," in"," the"," late"," ","19","th"," century",".\n\n","Here","'s"," what"," happens",":\n\n","1","."," **","Sun","light"," en